# request: "For the PR description, show list_orders.sql before and after the
#  switch from OFFSET paging to keyset paging, and say why it is faster: page
#  2001 now reads 50 rows instead of 100,050."
type: code-compare
reader: reviewers of the paging PR
width: 800
direction: right   # before | after, the note under them
focus: none
out: the index definition, the API change for the page cursor, the file name (list_orders.sql: the page caption names it)
nodes:
  h1: Before
  h2: After
  before: * {code}   # queries/list_orders.sql at main
  after: * {code}    # queries/list_orders.sql in the PR
  change: Keyset paging seeks the index: page 2001\nreads 50 rows instead of 100,050
edges:
